on covers return value, `bs->pos`, and all 32 struct bytes of 4 granule slots (pre-filled `0xA5` so C's *untouched* fields — `region_count[2]`, `subblock_gain[]` — are verified as untouched), plus the dereferenced `sfbtab` row\n\n### Harness validated by mutation testing\n**27 injected single-token mutations, 27 killed, 0 survivors** (every comparison operator, every `get_bits` bit-width, shift amounts, constants, swapped field writes, `.rodata` offsets, `pos`-advance ordering, granule pointer increment, `part_23_sum` accumulation).\n\nTwo remaining `cargo clippy` style lints (`unneeded late initialization`, missing `# Safety`) are intentional — they preserve the literal structure of the C. No `cargo build` warnings. `c_src/` unmodified apart from its own `build/` directory. No binary target exists in either project, so the stdout-comparison step does not apply."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":761,"cache_read_input_tokens":154014,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":761,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ff17bb9-40c1-4ea3-9b7d-37ecb13a0343","uuid":"dfd279c9-5632-443c-b19e-090f699fd0a4","timestamp":"2026-09-05T01:56:27.735Z"}
